<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>They brought Him one (they brought Him one)</l><l>Who couldn’t hear (who couldn’t hear)</l><l>Or speak too well; (or speak too well)</l><l>Please fix his ear! (Please fix his ear!)</l><l>They brought Him one who couldn’t hear (who couldn’t hear)</l><l>Or speak too well; please fix his ear. (Please fix his ear!)</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>The deaf man heard, (the deaf man heard)</l><l>The blind man saw; (the blind man saw)</l><l>The people all (the people all)</l><l>Were filled with awe! (were filled with awe!)</l><l>The deaf man heard, the blind man saw; (the blind man saw)</l><l>The people all were filled with awe! (were filled with awe!)</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>Now who could heal (now who could heal)</l><l>Such things as these? (such things as these)</l><l>Cure all of them (cure all of them)</l><l>Of their disease? (of their disease)</l><l>It’s only God and He was pleased (and He was pleased)</l><l>To care for them and set them free! (and set them free!)</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
